WEBVTT

00:00:00.127 --> 00:00:02.472
{happy}Hello, and welcome to Shah Spectrum.

00:00:02.472 --> 00:00:05.522
If you're new here, welcome.

00:00:05.522 --> 00:00:08.807
If you're back again, it's lovely to have you with us.

00:00:09.577 --> 00:00:15.358
Days after its chief executive resigned, Nvidia, the AI chip maker, has to report

00:00:15.358 --> 00:00:15.962
its results.

00:00:15.962 --> 00:00:20.051
What does a company do on a day like that, and what should we listen for?

00:00:20.881 --> 00:00:26.369
I'm Mittal Shah, and I'll take you through what changed, what results day is really

00:00:26.369 --> 00:00:28.230
about, and what nobody knows yet.

00:00:28.230 --> 00:00:34.116
{fluent}On the eleventh of November, the board of Nvidia accepted the resignation of

00:00:34.116 --> 00:00:39.321
Jensen Huang as chief executive, president and board member, effective immediately.

00:00:39.321 --> 00:00:41.565
The company announced it the next day.

00:00:41.565 --> 00:00:42.983
It gave no reason.

00:00:43.774 --> 00:00:48.294
Colette Kress, Nvidia's chief financial officer since 2013, is now interim chief

00:00:48.294 --> 00:00:53.716
executive, and she keeps her role as chief financial officer too.

00:00:53.716 --> 00:00:55.525
Interim means temporary:

00:00:55.525 --> 00:01:00.366
she leads while the board searches for a permanent chief executive, looking at

00:01:00.366 --> 00:01:03.840
candidates from inside and outside the company.

00:01:03.840 --> 00:01:08.688
Harvey Jones, a director since 1993, becomes the board's first-ever chair, the

00:01:08.688 --> 00:01:10.863
person who runs its meetings.

00:01:10.863 --> 00:01:14.662
He says the board expects operations, customer commitments and the product roadmap

00:01:14.662 --> 00:01:17.796
to continue without interruption.

00:01:18.768 --> 00:01:24.056
Separately, on the eighth of November, the board announced an independent

00:01:24.056 --> 00:01:27.818
investigation, after press reports that Huang had been the target of a foreign

00:01:27.818 --> 00:01:29.055
intelligence effort.

00:01:29.055 --> 00:01:31.129
Those reports are unproven.

00:01:31.129 --> 00:01:36.983
The board said it had no reason to believe national security or company secrets were

00:01:36.983 --> 00:01:38.339
compromised.

00:01:38.339 --> 00:01:44.310
Two days later, the independent directors said they had retained a former senior

00:01:44.310 --> 00:01:49.266
federal prosecutor in New York, Joon Kim, and his law firm as outside lawyers.

00:01:49.266 --> 00:01:54.375
The announcement of the resignation does not mention the investigation, and no

00:01:54.375 --> 00:01:56.323
findings have been published.

00:01:57.100 --> 00:01:57.934
Now, results day.

00:01:57.934 --> 00:02:02.981
A company whose shares trade on a stock exchange must report its results every three

00:02:02.981 --> 00:02:04.374
months:

00:02:04.374 --> 00:02:07.485
how much it sold, which is its revenue, and how much it earned.

00:02:07.485 --> 00:02:11.347
Nvidia's quarter ended on the twenty-fifth of October.

00:02:11.347 --> 00:02:16.850
It reports on the seventeenth of November, at about twenty past one in the afternoon

00:02:16.850 --> 00:02:18.177
in California.

00:02:18.177 --> 00:02:22.504
In India, that is around ten to three on the morning of the eighteenth.

00:02:23.278 --> 00:02:24.875
Here is the baseline.

00:02:24.875 --> 00:02:30.900
In the quarter before, Nvidia reported revenue of ninety-six point two billion

00:02:30.900 --> 00:02:34.293
dollars, up one hundred and six per cent from a year earlier.

00:02:34.293 --> 00:02:39.358
Its data centre business, the part that sells to the companies building AI data

00:02:39.358 --> 00:02:42.152
centres, brought in eighty-nine billion of that.

00:02:42.152 --> 00:02:44.779
That is more than nine-tenths of the total.

00:02:45.546 --> 00:02:50.449
Nvidia also gave a forecast for the quarter that ended on the twenty-fifth of

00:02:50.449 --> 00:02:51.089
October.

00:02:51.089 --> 00:02:56.607
It said revenue would be about one hundred and eight billion dollars, give or take

00:02:56.607 --> 00:02:57.288
two per cent.

00:02:57.288 --> 00:03:02.567
That is a range of roughly one hundred and six to one hundred and ten billion.

00:03:02.567 --> 00:03:08.437
It also said the forecast assumes no revenue from data centre computing products in

00:03:08.437 --> 00:03:09.037
China.

00:03:09.665 --> 00:03:15.042
So results day will show whether revenue came inside the company's own range, and

00:03:15.042 --> 00:03:17.697
what the company says about the next quarter.

00:03:18.483 --> 00:03:20.475
One fact is already settled.

00:03:20.475 --> 00:03:26.294
The quarter ended before the resignation, so the results cover a quarter from before

00:03:26.294 --> 00:03:27.069
the change.

00:03:27.069 --> 00:03:28.697
Open questions remain:

00:03:28.697 --> 00:03:33.606
who becomes the permanent chief executive, and how long that takes.

00:03:34.284 --> 00:03:34.985
What do we not know?

00:03:34.985 --> 00:03:35.685
Why Huang resigned.

00:03:35.685 --> 00:03:37.742
How long the search will run.

00:03:37.742 --> 00:03:40.101
What the investigation will find.

00:03:40.101 --> 00:03:43.033
And, until the results are out, how the quarter went.

00:03:43.732 --> 00:03:44.368
To sum up:

00:03:44.368 --> 00:03:46.679
Nvidia reports under interim leadership.

00:03:46.679 --> 00:03:49.952
Results day covers a quarter that ended before the change.

00:03:49.952 --> 00:03:54.016
What the change means for the company is still an open question.

00:03:54.841 --> 00:03:58.132
Nvidia is a listed company, so a quick note:

00:03:58.132 --> 00:04:01.713
this is news and explanation, not investment advice.

00:04:01.713 --> 00:04:07.725
Before you go, our episode from the sixth of November, 'AI shares sell-off:

00:04:07.725 --> 00:04:12.084
data centres and the election', looks at an earlier chapter of the AI story.

00:04:12.084 --> 00:04:14.269
The link is in the description.

00:04:14.269 --> 00:04:17.674
{happy}Thanks for listening, and see you in the next episode!

